# Notion Internal Integration Secret
# 1. Create an internal integration at https://www.notion.so/my-integrations
# 2. Copy its "Internal Integration Secret" here (starts with 'ntn_' or 'secret_')
# 3. IMPORTANT: share each page you want to read with the integration:
#    open the page in Notion > ... menu (top right) > Connections > add your integration
NOTION_API_TOKEN=ntn_your_secret_here
